  "body": "As implemented in Chromium Canary, `HTMLInputElement.showPicker()` allows to edit a `readonly` or `disabled` field. I don't see anything in the spec that would prevent this, but that seems confusing / broken?\r\n\r\nIf it's intended, it probably should at least be called out in the spec explicitly.\r\n\r\ncc @domenic @beaufortfrancois",
